  "title": "fix: govern cloud sign-in and session custody through Dactyl",
  "commit_message": "fix: route governed cloud sessions and readiness through Dactyl",
  "intent": "Implement issue1628 client slice: logical project backend, all managed discovery/auth/account/data transport through Dactyl, repository/project/origin-bound private custody with serialized refresh and crash recovery, honest server-confirmed readiness, explicit account denial/action requirements, headless continuation and no cloud-to-SQLite fallback. Preserve local independence and existing governed publication/release dependency gates.",
